@startuml Hotel_Booking_Flow
title Book Hotels (UC#6) — Analysis View

actor Traveler
participant "Mobile App" as App
participant "Backend" as Backend
participant "Database" as DB

== Explore Hotels ==

Traveler -> App: Browse hotel options
activate App

App -> Backend: Request hotels for city
activate Backend

Backend -> DB: Query available hotels
activate DB
DB --> Backend: Hotel list with details
deactivate DB

Backend --> App: Hotel options\n{name, price, rating}
deactivate Backend

App --> Traveler: Display hotels
deactivate App

== Select and Book Hotel ==

Traveler -> App: Select hotel and book
activate App

App -> Backend: Book selected hotel
activate Backend

Backend -> DB: Create booking record
activate DB

alt Booking created
  DB --> Backend: Booking saved
  deactivate DB

  Backend --> App: Booking confirmed\nwith confirmation number
  deactivate Backend

  App --> Traveler: Hotel booked, proceed\nto payment
  deactivate App

else Booking failed
  DB --> Backend: Booking failed
  deactivate DB

  Backend --> App: Booking failed
  deactivate Backend

  App --> Traveler: Unable to book\nplease try again
  deactivate App
end

== Cancel a Booking (before payment) ==

Traveler -> App: Cancel hotel booking
activate App

App -> Backend: Cancel booking\n{booking_id}
activate Backend

Backend -> DB: Mark booking as cancelled
activate DB
DB --> Backend: Booking cancelled
deactivate DB

Backend --> App: Booking cancelled
deactivate Backend

App --> Traveler: Hotel booking cancelled
deactivate App

@enduml
